> f(x: u8 in 0..3) = x / 0
> domain f
domain of f:
  x: u8, 0..3
  requires 0 != 0  (in x/0)
  defined at 0 of 4 points
  empty domain: undefined at every point of the parameter types
  undefined e.g. at x=0; x=1; x=2; x=3
  C undefined behaviour at 4 points, e.g. x=0
  over all 4 points of the domain
> range f
range of f -> u8:
  empty (undefined everywhere)
  undefined at 4 points
  over all 4 points of the domain
> g(x: u8, y: u8 in 0..3) = x / y
> domain g
domain of g:
  x: u8, 0..255
  y: u8, 0..3
  requires y != 0  (in x/y)
  defined at 768 of 1024 points
  undefined e.g. at x=0, y=0; x=1, y=0; x=2, y=0; x=3, y=0
  C undefined behaviour at 256 points, e.g. x=0, y=0
  over all 1024 points of the domain
> h(x: i8 in -3..3) = x % (x-x)
> domain h
domain of h:
  x: i8, -3..3
  requires 0 != 0  (in x % 0)
  defined at 0 of 7 points
  empty domain: undefined at every point of the parameter types
  undefined e.g. at x=-3; x=-2; x=-1; x=0
  C undefined behaviour at 7 points, e.g. x=-3
  over all 7 points of the domain
